            "review_title": "Review at Phở A2 - Authentic Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Andy T Huang\n2 contributions\n0\nThe tastiest Pho in Saigon\nJun 2024 • Solo\nA small Pho restaurant with a history of more than 30 years, exists in an alley in HCMC, where you can enjoy authentic traditional Vietnamese dishes. Pleasant garden space with extremely hospitable and professional service from the owner. Highly highly recommended. Enjoy a bowl of their pho, will make you come back again and again. Good job, Pho A2...\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2024",
